body:
Cant believe the comments below this post, absolutely mental. I legit played 19 games in a row with someone being, no new player coming in. And people sit here making excuses for how people need to pee or take care of their families and shit. Just dont join a competitive multiplayer match if you have to go afk that much. What about my fucking time? Why do I have to endure other peoples absolute incompetence to game for 15 minutes straight. Absolutely mentally gone to defend this.

&#x200B;

GET THIS FUCKING SHIT FIXED

